## Event Catalogue

| # | Event name | Trigger | Payload fields | Rate cap | Feeds goal/chart |
|---|-----------|---------|---------------|----------|-----------------|
| 1 | `session_start` | Game loads to `playing` | `{ts, build_sha}` | 1/session | goal.sessions |
| 2 | `session_end` | Tab close / game over | `{ts, duration_ms, final_state}` | 1/session | goal.session_length |
| 3 | `death` | Player loses a life | `{cause, pos, life_remaining, ms_since_playable}` | 50/session | goal.deaths_per_session |
| 4 | `win` | Win condition met | `{ts, score, duration_ms}` | 1/session | goal.win_rate |
| 5 | `level_complete` | Level/wave cleared | `{level, score, duration_ms}` | 20/session | goal.progression |
| 6 | `enemy_kill` | Enemy destroyed | `{type, weapon, pos}` | 100/session | chart.top_kills |
| 7 | `powerup_pickup` | Collectible gathered | `{type, pos}` | 50/session | chart.pickup_distribution |
| 8 | `input_idle` | No input for 5s during `playing` | `{idle_ms, state}` | 10/session | goal.engagement |

## Rate Cap Summary

| Aggregate | Target | Notes |
|-----------|--------|-------|
| Events/second (avg) | ≤ 2.0 | Measured over 60s window |
| Events/session (total) | ≤ 300 | Covers 3min session at peak |
| Payload size (per event) | ≤ 512 bytes | JSON stringified |

